# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Scratch verification screenshots/artifacts (see agent memory) — not shipped.
# EXCEPTION: the OFFLINE #148 hardening regression proof IS tracked (belongs
# in history + CI + the dev handoff — it guards a public-facing money-guard).
# Uses `_verify/*` (not `_verify/`) so git descends into the dir and the
# negation below can re-include that one file. The real-key proofs
# (proof-148-realmoney-*, proof-148-stt-arclip) stay ignored — they need a
# live key + real spend, not CI-safe.
_verify/*
!_verify/proof-148-backend-hardening.mjs

# Parallel-agent git worktrees (each is its own linked checkout, on its
# own branch — not this repo's content; also scanned by oxlint before
# #147 P2-e added the matching .oxlintrc.json ignorePatterns entry)
.claude/worktrees/

# On-device Arabic speech-recognition assets (#150) — ~317MB, vendored
# by `npm run fetch-models` (auto-runs as `prebuild`) from Hugging Face
# + jsdelivr at build time so the SHIPPED app never depends on either
# host at runtime. Too large to commit; every dev/CI machine fetches its
# own copy once (idempotent, see scripts/fetch-models.mjs).
public/models/
public/ort/

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Secrets — never commit (Nibras keeps all AI/provider keys server-side, never in this client bundle)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Backend spend-cap ledger (#148) — machine-local usage state written by
# server/index.ts's spend cap, not source. Never committed.
server/.usage/

# "Rate Nibras" feedback log — best-effort JSON-lines written by
# server/api/feedback.ts (console.info is the reliable channel). Ephemeral
# machine/container-local state, not source. Never committed.
server/.feedback/

# Claude Code workspace state (never ship)
.claude/
